<title>USA: Valmont Industries sets up Brazil unit.</title>
<headline>Valmont Industries sets up Brazil unit.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY, Neb. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valmont Industries Inc said it formed a new company with its joint venture licensee to make mechanized irrigation equipment in Brazil.</p>
<p>The company said the deal is expected to expand its participation in the irrigation market in South America and improve service to its customers.</p>
<p>Valmont makes agricultural irrigation systems.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/8 Tuesday at 42-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
